  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n50% of 20% of (2/3) of a number = 686\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nNumber × 50/100 × 20/100 × 2/3 = 686\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nLet the number be x.\n\n⇒ x × 50/100 × 20/100 × 2/3 = 686\n\n⇒ x × 1/2 × 1/5 × 2/3 = 686\n\n⇒ x × (1 × 1 × 2)/(2 × 5 × 3) = 686\n\n⇒ x × 2/30 = 686\n\n⇒ x = 686 × 30/2\n\n⇒ x = 343 × 30\n\n⇒ x = 10290\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
